---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "Portugal Considered";
const description =
  "Practical, decision-driven travel guidance for planning a better Portugal vacation.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="hero-image">
    <img
      src="/images/portugal-considered-hero-douro.jpg"
      alt="Douro River winding through terraced vineyards and a village in northern Portugal"
    />
  </section>

  <section class="home-intro">
    <div class="home-intro-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Travel Portugal with intention</p>

      <h1>Portugal, considered.</h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Practical guidance for deciding where to go, how long to stay,
        and what deserves a place in your Portugal vacation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="planning-section">
    <div class="planning-intro">
      <h2>Planning Your First Portugal Trip?</h2>

      <p>
        Start with the decisions that shape the trip: where to spend your
        time, how long each destination deserves, and what is worth leaving
        out.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="planning-grid">
      <article class="planning-card">
        <img
          src="/images/lisbon-santa-luzia-alfama-travelers.jpg"
          alt="Travelers overlooking the rooftops of Alfama in Lisbon"
        />

        <h3>Where should I go?</h3>

        <p>
          Compare Portugal's major destinations and decide which places
          deserve a spot in your trip.
        </p>

        <a href="/destinations/">Explore destinations →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="planning-card">
        <img
          src="/images/porto-douro-riverfront-travelers.jpg"
          alt="Travelers walking along the Douro River waterfront in Porto"
        />

        <h3>How long do I need?</h3>

        <p>
          Decide how many days Portugal—and the places within it—really
          deserve.
        </p>

        <a href="/trip-planning/">Plan your time →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="planning-card">
        <img
          src="/images/portugal-train-travelers.jpg"
          alt="Travelers boarding a passenger train in Portugal"
        />

        <h3>How should I put the trip together?</h3>

        <p>
          Make sense of bases, transportation, and the order that turns
          separate destinations into one practical trip.
        </p>

        <a href="/trip-planning/">Build your itinerary →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="explore-section">
    <div class="explore-intro">
      <h2>Explore Portugal</h2>

      <p>
        Thoughtful destination guidance for building a Portugal trip around
        the places and experiences that matter to you.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="explore-grid">
      <article class="explore-card">
        <img
          src="/images/alto-douro-vineyards-river.jpg"
          alt="Terraced vineyards overlooking the Douro River in northern Portugal"
        />

        <h3>Porto &amp; the Douro Valley</h3>

        <p>
          Pair historic Porto with the river, vineyards, villages, and
          landscapes of the Douro Valley.
        </p>

        <a href="/destinations/">Explore Porto &amp; the Douro →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="explore-card">
        <img
          src="/images/sintra-pena-palace-travelers.jpg"
          alt="Visitors exploring Pena Palace in Sintra, Portugal"
        />

        <h3>Lisbon &amp; Central Portugal</h3>

        <p>
          Build around Lisbon, then consider Sintra, Cascais, and the places
          that make the surrounding region worth exploring.
        </p>

        <a href="/destinations/">Explore Lisbon &amp; Central Portugal →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="explore-card">
        <img
          src="/images/algarve-praia-do-camilo.jpg"
          alt="Atlantic coastline and cliffs at Praia do Camilo in the Algarve"
        />

        <h3>Beyond the Two Cities</h3>

        <p>
          Look beyond Porto and Lisbon to the Algarve, Alentejo, Madeira,
          and other parts of Portugal worth considering.
        </p>

        <a href="/destinations/">Explore more of Portugal →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="decisions-section">
    <div class="decisions-inner">
      <div class="decisions-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Before you book</p>

        <h2>Decisions Worth Making Before You Book</h2>

        <p>
          Some travel decisions become harder—or more expensive—to change once
          the trip is underway. Portugal Considered helps you make those
          decisions while you still have choices.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="decisions-grid">
        <article class="decision-item">
          <h3>Day Trip or Overnight?</h3>

          <p>
            Some places are easy to visit in a day but more rewarding with
            time to stay. Decide when an overnight is worth changing your
            itinerary.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="decision-item">
          <h3>Train, Car, or Transfer?</h3>

          <p>
            The best way to get around Portugal depends on where you are
            going and what you want to experience. Choose transportation
            that fits the trip rather than complicates it.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="decision-item">
          <h3>Where Should You Base Yourself?</h3>

          <p>
            Changing hotels can open up a region—or simply add packing and
            travel time. Decide when another base genuinely improves the
            trip.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 500px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-sand);
  }

  .hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 52%;
  }

  .home-intro {
    padding: 80px 28px 85px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .home-intro-inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-green);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 82px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 28px auto 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .planning-section,
  .explore-section {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 65px 28px 75px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-sand);
  }

  .planning-intro,
  .explore-intro {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
  }

  .planning-intro h2,
  .explore-intro h2,
  .decisions-intro h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .planning-intro p,
  .explore-intro p,
  .decisions-intro p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .planning-grid,
  .explore-grid,
  .decisions-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .planning-card img,
  .explore-card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 230px;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .planning-card h3,
  .explore-card h3,
  .decision-item h3 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .planning-card p,
  .explore-card p,
  .decision-item p {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .planning-card a,
  .explore-card a {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .planning-card a:hover,
  .explore-card a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .decisions-section {
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 75px 28px 80px;
    background: var(--color-sand);
  }

  .decisions-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .decisions-intro {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: 45px;
  }

  .decisions-intro .eyebrow {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .decision-item {
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--color-green);
  }

  .decision-item p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .planning-grid,
    .explore-grid,
    .decisions-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }

    .planning-card img,
    .explore-card img {
      height: 300px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hero-image {
      height: 330px;
    }

    .hero-image img {
      object-position: center center;
    }

    .home-intro {
      padding: 60px 22px 65px;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .planning-section,
    .explore-section {
      padding: 48px 22px 55px;
    }

    .planning-card img,
    .explore-card img {
      height: 240px;
    }

    .decisions-section {
      padding: 55px 22px 60px;
    }
  }
</style>
